  "details": "Subject: Group Invites Bug – Can’t Send Invites After a While\n\nHi VRChat team,\n\nI’m having an issue where I can’t send group invites after being in the app for a while. It works at first, but eventually the option disappears or stops working. This also affects my staff, even though they have the correct permissions.\n\nRestarting VRChat temporarily fixes it, but it keeps coming back. We’ve tried new instances, reassigning roles, and clearing cache, but the issue still happens across different devices.\n\nPlease look into this—it’s affecting how we manage events and group activities.\n\nThanks,\n\nGhostface",
